{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01A712e8gyf4wGT27sGA6kvf","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-15-0100-batch-global-gkr-input-eval\n2\t\n3\tReplace per-AIR GLOBAL-mode GKR input evaluation kernel launches with a single batched descriptor-array kernel for small AIRs (height ≤ TASK_SIZE). Currently each of ~300 GLOBAL AIRs at APC 300 launches a 256-block kernel with TASK_SIZE=65536 threads regardless of actual height, wasting 90-99% of threads for small AIRs and serializing execution across 8 streams. A batched kernel with per-AIR descriptors processes all small GLOBAL AIRs in one launch with right-sized block counts, enabling GPU-native block scheduling instead of coarse-grained stream scheduling, and eliminating ~300 kernel launch overheads per segment.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5bb7d674-211a-472f-a536-7708d797558d","uuid":"3d45cec8-a0f5-497a-b709-d93fba722fa3","timestamp":"2026-04-15T02:18:08.331Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md","content":"# 2026-04-15-0100-batch-global-gkr-input-eval\n\nReplace per-AIR GLOBAL-mode GKR input evaluation kernel launches with a single batched descriptor-array kernel for small AIRs (height ≤ TASK_SIZE). Currently each of ~300 GLOBAL AIRs at APC 300 launches a 256-block kernel with TASK_SIZE=65536 threads regardless of actual height, wasting 90-99% of threads for small AIRs and serializing execution across 8 streams. A batched kernel with per-AIR descriptors processes all small GLOBAL AIRs in one launch with right-sized block counts, enabling GPU-native block scheduling instead of coarse-grained stream scheduling, and eliminating ~300 kernel launch overheads per segment.\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}}}
