{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01D3NaBXLzCYNNumCYUfSsM9","type":"tool_result","content":"300\t- At least `w` sumcheck rounds remain (`rounds_left >= w`)\n301\t- Estimated tail parallelism meets threshold: `num_tail_blocks(rem_n, w, tail_tile) >= min_blocks`, where `min_blocks` defaults to 64 (`SWIRL_CUDA_GKR_PRECOMPUTE_M_MIN_BLOCKS`)\n302\t\n303\t`tail_tile` is chosen adaptively from a target block count (default 1024, `SWIRL_CUDA_GKR_PRECOMPUTE_M_TARGET_BLOCKS`) and clamped to `[256, 4096]`, unless explicitly set by `SWIRL_CUDA_GKR_PRECOMPUTE_M_TAIL_TILE`.\n304\t\n305\tOtherwise it falls back to fold-eval.\n306\t\n307\t### Additional buffers\n308\t- `m_buffer` — the `4^w`-sized M matrix (`DeviceBuffer<EF>`)\n309\t- `m_partial_buffer` — partial M blocks from each CUDA thread block\n310\t- `eq_r_prefix_buffer`, `eq_suffix_buffer` — small device buffers for MLE evaluation tables (size `<= 2^w`)\n311\t- `d_sum_evals` — two `EF` values holding `s'(1)` and `s'(2)` from each round\n312\t- `tmp_block_sums` — block-level partial sums for reduction; reused for `eq_r_window` upload during multifold (safe because the two uses don't overlap temporally)\n313\t\n314\t### GPU memory accounting\n315\t\n316\tLet:\n317\t- `n = log2(total_leaves)`\n318\t- `w = GKR_WINDOW_SIZE` (default `w = 3`)\n319\t- `|EF| = sizeof(EF)` bytes\n320\t- `|Frac| = sizeof(Frac<EF>) = 2 * |EF|`\n321\t- Assume `n` is large\n322\t- Assume precompute-M is active\n323\t\n324\tBuffers used at peak (workspace only; excludes input `layer`/leaves):\n325\t- `work_buffer`: `2^(n-w-2) * |Frac|` (precompute-M defers `w+1` folds before first write)\n326\t- `copy_scratch`: `1 * |Frac|`\n327\t- `d_sum_evals`: `2 * |EF|`\n328\t- `tmp_block_sums`: `< 2^(n-7) * |EF|`\n329\t- `eq_buffer` (`SqrtEqLayers`): `(2^floor(n/2) + 2^ceil(n/2) - 2) * |EF|`\n330\t- `m_buffer`: `4^w * |EF|` (default `w=3` gives `64 * |EF|`)\n331\t- `m_partial_buffer`: `num_blocks * 4^w * |EF|`, with `num_blocks <= 2^(n-w-10)` for large `n`, so `< 2^(n+w-10) * |EF|`\n332\t- `eq_r_prefix_buffer` + `eq_suffix_buffer`: `2^(w+1) * |EF|` (default `w=3` gives `16 * |EF|`)\n333\t\n334\tWorkspace upper bound (sum of the buffers above), using `|Frac| = 2 * |EF|`:\n335\t- `W < (2^(n-w-1) + 2^(n-7) + 2^(n+w-10) + 2^floor(n/2) + 2^ceil(n/2) + 4^w + 2^(w+1) + 2) * |EF|`\n336\t\n337\tTotal GPU memory required (workspace + input leaves `2^n * |Frac| = 2^(n+1) * |EF|`):\n338\t- `M_total < (2^(n+1) + 2^(n-w-1) + 2^(n-7) + 2^(n+w-10) + 2^floor(n/2) + 2^ceil(n/2) + 4^w + 2^(w+1) + 2) * |EF|`\n339\t- With default `w = 3` and `|EF| = 16` bytes:\n340\t  - `M_total < (2^(n+1) + 2^(n-4) + 2^(n-6) + 2^floor(n/2) + 2^ceil(n/2) + 82) / 2^26 GiB`\n341\t  - `n = 27`: `M_total < 4.16 GiB`\n342\t  - `n = 28`: `M_total < 8.31 GiB`\n343\t  - `n = 29`: `M_total < 16.63 GiB`\n344\t  - `n = 30`: `M_total < 33.25 GiB`\n345\t\n346\tDominant term is the input leaves (`2^(n+1) * |EF|`). Workspace overhead is ~4%.\n347\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01AtdyzMWMsZyBSR8LM8TksV","session_id":"5bb7d674-211a-472f-a536-7708d797558d","uuid":"6411754c-04d1-4867-a75d-786e8476f715","timestamp":"2026-04-15T02:31:02.406Z"}
