ment, during Merkle tree construction**:\n\n1. **File**: `/crates/cuda-backend/src/merkle_tree.rs` line 130\n   ```rust\n   unsafe {\n       MH::compress_rows(&mut query_digest_layer, matrix.buffer(), ...)\n   }\n   ```\n\n2. **Via trait dispatch** → `Poseidon2MerkleHash::compress_rows()` \n   **File**: `/crates/cuda-backend/src/hash_scheme.rs` line 121-129\n\n3. **Calls FFI wrapper** → `poseidon2_compressing_row_hashes()` \n   **File**: `/crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/merkle_tree.rs` line 52-68\n\n4. **Launches CUDA kernel** → `_poseidon2_compressing_row_hashes` \n   **File**: `/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/merkle_tree.cu` line 214-230\n\n**Called 25 times** because:\n- 1 call per segment in `stacked_per_commit` during opening proofs\n- Possibly multiple segments being processed (common_main + per-air segments)\n- Each call processes different RS codeword matrix\n\n**Total work**: 231ms / 25 = 9.2ms per segment's row hashing & binary tree merge\n\nThis is the third-largest component (86ms seg1 + extra context = 231ms window) because it combines two expensive operations: **row hashing** (Poseidon2 per row) + **in-block Merkle tree compression** (binary tree of 2^log_rows_per_query leaves)."}],"totalDurationMs":60023,"totalTokens":87893,"totalToolUseCount":26,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3519,"cache_read_input_tokens":81405,"output_tokens":2964,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3519},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":5,"output_tokens":2964,"cache_read_input_tokens":81405,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3519,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3519,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":11,"searchCount":10,"bashCount":5,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
