` | 1-736 |\n| **Monomial Batch** | `cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.rs` | 1-700+ |\n| **precompute_logup_combinations_kernel** | `cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.cu` | 304-364 |\n| **zerocheck_batch_mle_kernel** | `cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle.cu` | 109-205 |\n| **logup_batch_mle_kernel** | `cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle.cu` | 206-356 |\n| **fold_ple_from_evals_kernel** | `cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/utils.cu` | 24-287 |\n| **batched_interpolate_columns_matrix_kernel** | `cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/utils.cu` | 151-239 |\n| **zerocheck_monomial_kernel** | `cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.cu` | 102-196 |\n| **zerocheck_monomial_par_y_kernel** | `cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.cu` | 198-288 |\n\n---\n\n### **Recommendations for Investigation**\n\n1. **Profile descriptor/H2D overhead:**\n   - Add timing around CPU descriptor construction (phase 1)\n   - Measure total H2D transfer time per round vs kernel time\n   - Compare trace counts per round (APC 300 vs APC 0)\n\n2. **Check batch consolidation:**\n   - Verify whether APC 300 creates more kernel launches due to threshold effects\n   - Log `early_eval.len()`, `late_eval.len()`, and split counts per round\n\n3. **Analyze kernel occupancy:**\n   - `zerocheck_monomial_par_y_kernel` may underutilize SM with many traces\n   - Compare with `zerocheck_batch_mle_kernel` efficiency\n\n4. **Memory BW analysis:**\n   - Fold ping-pong buffers may be bottleneck\n   - Check if descriptor H2D transfers overlap with kernel execution"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5bb7d674-211a-472f-a536-7708d797558d","uuid":"be5467c0-2b7f-4cee-8399-6df7d0995f12","timestamp":"2026-04-15T02:31:45.832Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"I need to understand the MLE Rounds code path in this CUDA-accelerated STARK prover. MLE Rounds take 158ms at APC 300 vs 112ms at APC 0 