ogup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.cu` | 102-196 |\n| **zerocheck_monomial_par_y_kernel** | `cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.cu` | 198-288 |\n\n---\n\n### **Recommendations for Investigation**\n\n1. **Profile descriptor/H2D overhead:**\n   - Add timing around CPU descriptor construction (phase 1)\n   - Measure total H2D transfer time per round vs kernel time\n   - Compare trace counts per round (APC 300 vs APC 0)\n\n2. **Check batch consolidation:**\n   - Verify whether APC 300 creates more kernel launches due to threshold effects\n   - Log `early_eval.len()`, `late_eval.len()`, and split counts per round\n\n3. **Analyze kernel occupancy:**\n   - `zerocheck_monomial_par_y_kernel` may underutilize SM with many traces\n   - Compare with `zerocheck_batch_mle_kernel` efficiency\n\n4. **Memory BW analysis:**\n   - Fold ping-pong buffers may be bottleneck\n   - Check if descriptor H2D transfers overlap with kernel execution"}],"totalDurationMs":88772,"totalTokens":80971,"totalToolUseCount":44,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2557,"cache_read_input_tokens":75118,"output_tokens":3296,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2557},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":3296,"cache_read_input_tokens":75118,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2557,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2557,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":22,"searchCount":0,"bashCount":22,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
